  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電子學",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTRONICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程討論電路理論應用在電子元件上並介紹半導體電子元件以及其物理現象。學生可以從本課程學到如何分析含有電子元件的電路。本課程同時介紹電子元件的應用。",
    "describe_eh": "The basic circuit theory being applied to electronic devices is discussed in this course. Some solid state electronics are introduced. Physical phenomena of these electronic devices are illustrated. Students can learn how to analyze electric circuits with electronics devices from this course. The applications of electronic devices are also introduced.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
